<title>FINLAND: Finnish March industrial output up 8.8 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Finnish March industrial output up 8.8 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish industrial production adjusted for working days increased 8.8 percent year-on-year in March compared to a 6.7 percent rise in February, Statistics Finland (SF) said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>		   March 1997   Feb 1997   March 1996</p>
<p>		    +8.8 pct     +6.7 pct   +1.7 pct</p>
<p>Five economists' average forecast was for a growth rate of 6.2 percent (range 4.5-7.2 percent).</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358-0-680 50 245, news@reuters@.fi</p>
